  "prefLabel": "Agr 205.09 Declaratory Judgment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 205.09 Declaratory Judgment. If a rule interferes with an individual's legal rights or privileges, an action for declaratory judgment in the Merrimack County Superior Court may be brought, in accordance with RSA 541-A:24.\n\nSource. #8309-B, eff 3-24-05",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr200.html"
